{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Apple今晚推出HomeView 27.2系統更新，趕在裝置於11月13日正式上市之前發布。更新內容包括裝置預設桌布，每款均備有淺色及深色版本，可於下方下載。</p>\n<h2>HomeView桌公開示</h2>\n<p>Apple今晚有點耐人尋味地發布HomeView 27.2（版本編號24V514）。這款作業系統將驅動Apple全新智能家居控制中心，裝置現正接受預訂，並將於11月13日推出。</p>\n<p>是次更新包括隨裝置附送的20款桌布，全部均可於下方下載：</p>\n<h2>淺色模式Apple HomeView桌布</h2>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/environment1-light.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/environment2-light.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/environment3-light.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/environment4-light.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/gradient1-light.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/gradient2-light.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/gradient3-light.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/gradient4-light.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/gradient5-light.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/gradient6-light.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/gradient7-light.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/gradient8-light.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/illustrative1-light.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/illustrative2-light.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/illustrative3-light.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/illustrative4-light.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/material1-light.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/material2-light.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/material3-light.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/material4-light.png\"/>\n<h2>深色模式Apple HomeView桌布</h2>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/environment1-dark.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/environment2-dark.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/environment3-dark.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/environment4-dark.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/gradient1-dark.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/gradient2-dark.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/gradient3-dark.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/gradient4-dark.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/gradient5-dark.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/gradient6-dark.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/gradient7-dark.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/gradient8-dark.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/illustrative1-dark.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/illustrative2-dark.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/illustrative3-dark.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/illustrative4-dark.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/material1-dark.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/material2-dark.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/material3-dark.png\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/material4-dark.png\"/>\n<p>鑑於裝置尺寸，桌布採用1:1比例，但你可以輕易調整，以配合你裝置的屏幕比例。Apple在iPhone、iPad及Mac上均提供設定自訂桌布的內置選項，包括調整圖像在屏幕上的顯示方式。</p>\n<p>除桌布外，是次更新亦讓人提前窺見HomeView的錶盤自訂介面，由開發者Guilherme Rambo分享：</p>\n<p>有趣的是，系統內亦藏有一幅HomeView Software 26圖像，由Aaron Perris在X上分享，进一步印證此前有傳聞指Apple原定於去年推出這款裝置：</p>\n<p>你 favourite 邊款桌布？歡迎在留言告訴我們。</p>\n<h4>值得在Amazon上看看</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Apple HomeView</li>\n<li>Apple TV 4K（2026）</li>\n<li>Apple Watch Series 12 | Ultra 4</li>\n<li>AirPods Pro 3 | AirPods 5</li>\n<li>AirTag（第2代）—— 4件裝</li>\n<li>MacBook Neo</li>\n<li>Logitech MX Master 4</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:13.711657+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1580,"images":40,"source":"9to5Mac","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T01:03:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:18:30.846727+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:40.068371+00:00","content_hash":"40d278b9da4354335dc5aec1bc67002f509f4e9349534ea1288dcce1276529ed","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}